      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can pivot the conversation to the *threat actor evolution* rather than their current systems. Point out data indicating that advanced persistent threats (APTs) are increasing their speed and sophistication against companies of their size or sector. Frame the current security as meeting last year's standard, but strongly suggest that their best defense against a modern, persistent attacker is the proactive, real-time visibility offered by the monitoring package. This creates urgency by referencing external, unstoppable trends.",
      "source": "target",
